		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A sentient, floating fungoid bigger than a zeppelin. Harbors an alien, but not malign, intellect. Alchemists prize flesh for reagents.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 8, <strong>HP</strong> 75, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 tentacle (double near) +10 (6d6 + grab) or spore cough, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 18+ or held. STR 18+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to energy and non-magical damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spore Cough</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from mu spore. CON 15+ or 5d8 damage. Plants are immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
